    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present this bright and well-presented three-bedroom mid-terrace family home to the market, ideally positioned in a quiet and mature residential estate in Balruddery Wood, Balrothery, Co. Dublin. No. 4 is nestled within a peaceful cul-de-sac setting. This superb property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, those looking to trade down, and investors alike.\r\n\r\n Bright and well laid out internal living accommodation of approx. 81 sq.m. comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen/dining area to the front, and a spacious living room to the rear with direct access to the private garden. Upstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite and a main family bathroom.\r\n\r\n No. 4 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout having been recently decorated throughout and is presented in excellent condition. Additional benefits include double glazed windows, gas fired central heating, and a private, low maintenance rear garden that is private.  To the front, there is on-street parking, while the cul-de-sac setting ensures a quiet and peaceful location.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, situated within easy reach of Balrothery Village and just minutes from Balbriggan Town Centre, with an abundance of local amenities including reputable schools, shops, parks, beaches, and sports facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, with Balbriggan train station and frequent bus routes nearby, while the M1 motorway provides swift access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport, and beyond.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS - 01 8844690"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Main Hall\r\n5.81m x 1.85m\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\n3.19m x 2.32m\r\n\r\nBreakfast Room Area\r\n3m x 2.54m \r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.27m x 3.15m\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC\r\n1.75m x 0.88m \r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom \r\n4.27m x 3.92m\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.33m x 1.02m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.17m x 2.39m \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\n2.71m x 1.76m\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.32m x 1.02m\r\n\r\n** Overall area approx. 80 sq mtrs **\r\n**Please note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only**\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to ourselves. While every care is taken in preparing particulars the firm do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
