        "Content": "* An ideal first time buyer dream home spanning  80 m² / 861 ft² \r\n• Spacious 3 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom mid terraced townhouse\r\n• Gas fired central heating & BER C\r\n• Kitchen & Breakfast room to front / living room to rear\r\n• Private rear garden \r\n• On-street parking\r\n• Quiet cul de sac setting\r\n• Located in a mature residential estate\r\n• Close to local amenities\r\n• Easy access to M1 and transport links"
