      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Start in Balbriggan and head onto Dublin Street, continuing straight through the town. At the roundabout, take the second exit onto the R132. After approximately 2 km, turn left onto Old Coach Road.\r\nTake the next left onto School Lane, then right onto Coach Road. Continue straight and take a slight right onto Knightswood. Turn left into Balruddery Wood estate.\r\nFollow the road through the development, take the next right, then the next left, No. 4 is located on the right-hand side with a MoveHome For Sale sign."
